DESCRIPTION:In this talk we will see what the _Djangonaut Space_ program is
  up close\, understand its goal and its innovative strength. Analyzing it 
 from the _internal_ point of view\, but also from that of its _participant
 s_\, in the hope of inspiring other people to _participate_.
